A reference label across a line stays verbatim in every form

```
![x
y][]
.
<p>![x
y][]</p>
```

```
[*t*][a
b]
.
<p>[*t*][a
b]</p>
```

```
![*x*][a
b]
.
<p>![*x*][a
b]</p>
```

```
*[y]: z

[*x*
y][]
.
<p>[*x*
y][]</p>
```

```
*[y]: z

[x][y
q]
.
<p>[x][y
q]</p>
```

```
[x][a
b](u)
.
<p>[x][a
b](u)</p>
```
